"segments": [
{
"start": 0.63,
"end": 1.23,
"text": " Why don't you sit down?"
},
{
"start": 1.25,
"end": 2.21,
"text": "Sit down."
},
{
"start": 2.45,
"end": 4.55,
"text": "Now, y'all real happy about Michael's success?"
},
{
"start": 4.93,
"end": 8.65,
"text": "I mean, he can go all the way, right to the top, all by himself."
},
{
"start": 8.91,
"end": 9.79,
"text": "Wouldn't that be something?"
},
{
"start": 9.81,
"end": 12.61,
"text": "Let me tell you, the Jackson family is the brand."
},
{
"start": 12.83,
"end": 13.99,
"text": "That's our Coca-Cola."
},
{
"start": 14.17,
"end": 17.53,
"text": "Yeah, so we need to open up the store and start selling."
},
{
"start": 17.63,
"end": 18.49,
"text": "Well, you know what's going to happen?"
},
{
"start": 18.77,
"end": 20.47,
"text": "Folks going to go out there and start buying some Pepsi."
},
{
"start": 20.53,
"end": 23.07,
"text": "We got to get in there again and bend the wares."
},
{
"start": 24.51,
"end": 30.36,
"text": "I've decided I'm arranging a tour."
},
{
"start": 32.25,
"end": 35.41,
"text": " The point is we need to capitalize on Michael's album."
},
{
"start": 35.63,
"end": 37.72,
"text": "So we're going to do a bunch of songs."
},
{
"start": 37.74,
"end": 40.44,
"text": "Joseph, I need to think."
},
{
"start": 40.54,
"end": 41.06,
"text": "No, sir."
},
{
"start": 41.46,
"end": 42.48,
"text": "I told you what to think."
},
{
"start": 42.7,
"end": 43.78,
"text": "You got a problem with that, Michael?"
},
{
"start": 43.9,
"end": 46.68,
"text": "We need to have a reasonable conversation about this, Joseph."
},
{
"start": 47.06,
"end": 51.12,
"text": "You think now because you're a big superstar and you got this big hit album that you're better than everybody in this house."
},
{
"start": 51.51,
"end": 51.84,
"text": "Is that it?"
},
{
"start": 52.16,
"end": 52.51,
"text": "Is that it?"
},
{
"start": 52.74,
"end": 53.85,
"text": "You think you're better than me, boy?"
},
{
"start": 54.19,
"end": 55.75,
"text": "Joseph, that is enough."
},
{
"start": 55.77,
"end": 56.57,
"text": "That is enough."
}
]
}